      debugger), DisplayWidget (QImage 4:3 letterbox, QTimer pull),
      KeypadWindow (6x4 gold-column grid, press/release PadButton, System +
      Map rows), SettingsDialog (BIOS + expansion), DebuggerWindow (Z80 +
      Video chip tabs), KeyForward.
  [x] app-id online.fujinet.go.astrocade.kde; .desktop (adds Qt;) + metainfo
      validated. enable_language(CXX) scoped to this frontend (project is C).
  verify: ran on live Wayland (grim) -- native Qt window with Machine/View/
      FujiNet/Settings menu bar and the SELECT GAME display. Full ctest 10/10.

M7 — Linux packaging (DEB/RPM/TGZ + 2 flatpaks)  [x]
  [x] CPack per-frontend (already in root CMakeLists): one package per
      frontend, DEB;RPM;TGZ, auto-detected deps (shlibdeps / autoreqprov).
      TGZ verified: correct tree (bin, applications, icons x9 by app-id,
      metainfo). DEB/RPM need dpkg-deb/rpmbuild -- present on the CI runners.
  [x] flatpak manifests for both frontends (build-aux/flatpak/*.yml): SDL3
      pinned + fujinet-firmware pinned to the astrocade-bringup commit + the
      app (WITH_ASTROCADE_ROMS=OFF). GNOME runtime 49 / KDE 6.11. mbedTLS +
      python-webui deps + WITH_FUJINET are added with the FujiNet milestone.
  verify: GNOME flatpak builds end-to-end here (flatpak-builder: SDL3
      compiled, firmware fetched, app built, icons/desktop/metainfo exported,
      AppStream metadata composed). Pin recorded in 3 places (Dependencies +
      both manifests).

M8 — Windows (Win32 + fujitcp_win32.c + NSIS)  [ ]
M9 — macOS (AppKit bundle)  [ ]
M10 — CI + release  [ ]

Notes / gotchas confirmed so far
  - 113.75 CPU cycles/scanline: the master loop runs in DOT units (1 tick =
    4 dots, 455/line), remainder carried between lines. Do not round per line.
  - fujitcp.c is POSIX; a Winsock twin (fujitcp_win32.c) lands in M8. The
    core CMake already switches to it under WIN32.
  - The staged fujitcp.c needs _DEFAULT_SOURCE under -std=c11 (set in
    core/CMakeLists.txt).
